{"seq":3,"slug":"consistency-and-consensus","title":"复制一致性与共识算法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/data-intensive-applications/replication-and-partitioning/consistency-and-consensus","wordCount":1214,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"复制一致性与共识算法\">复制一致性与共识算法</h1><h2 id=\"概述\">概述</h2><p>在分布式系统中，复制引入了数据副本之间的不一致窗口，而共识算法则是实现副本间强一致性的基础设施。理解不同一致性级别的语义差异，以及共识算法如何在节点故障和网络分区下保证正确性，是设计可靠分布式系统的核心能力。</p>\n<p>本文从复制延迟引出的一致性问题出发，系统梳理各级一致性模型的定义与工程语义，并深入 Raft 共识算法的完整实现机制。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><h3 id=\"一致性级别谱系\">一致性级别谱系</h3><p>分布式系统中的一致性保证形成了一个从强到弱的连续谱系：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>级别</th>\n<th>保证</th>\n<th>性能代价</th>\n<th>典型系统</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>线性一致性 (Linearizability)</td>\n<td>所有操作如同在单节点上顺序执行</td>\n<td>极高</td>\n<td>ZooKeeper, etcd</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>顺序一致性 (Sequential)</td>\n<td>所有节点看到相同的操作顺序</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>很少单独使用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>因果一致性 (Causal)</td>\n<td>有因果关系的操作保持顺序</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>COPS, MongoDB Causal</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>读己之写 (Read-your-writes)</td>\n<td>用户总能看到自己的写入</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>大多数 Web 应用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>单调读 (Monotonic reads)</td>\n<td>不会看到比之前更旧的数据</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>会话一致性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>最终一致性 (Eventual)</td>\n<td>副本最终会收敛</td>\n<td>最低</td>\n<td>DynamoDB, Cassandra</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"线性一致性详解\">线性一致性详解</h3><p>线性一致性是最强的一致性模型，要求系统表现得如同只有一个数据副本：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"时间轴:&#10;Client A: |---write(x=1)---|&#10;Client B:           |---read(x)---| → 必须返回 1&#10;Client C:     |---read(x)---|       → 可能返回 0 或 1&#10;                                      (写入尚未完成时)&#10;&#10;核心约束: 一旦任何读取返回了新值，所有后续读取必须返回新值\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>时间轴:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Client A: |---write(x=1)---|</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Client B:           |---read(x)---| → 必须返回 1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Client C:     |---read(x)---|       → 可能返回 0 或 1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                                      (写入尚未完成时)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>核心约束: 一旦任何读取返回了新值，所有后续读取必须返回新值</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>线性一致性的代价（CAP 的具体体现）：</strong></p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[&quot;Network Partition Occurs&quot;] --&gt; B{&quot;Choose:&quot;}&#10;    B --&gt;|Linearizable| C[&quot;Reject writes/reads on minority side - Unavailable&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt;|Available| D[&quot;Accept operations on both sides - Not Linearizable&quot;]\">graph TD\n    A[\"Network Partition Occurs\"] --&gt; B{\"Choose:\"}\n    B --&gt;|Linearizable| C[\"Reject writes/reads on minority side - Unavailable\"]\n    B --&gt;|Available| D[\"Accept operations on both sides - Not Linearizable\"]</pre><h3 id=\"因果一致性\">因果一致性</h3><p>因果一致性只保证有因果关系的操作被所有节点以相同顺序观察到：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"操作 1: Alice 发帖 &quot;Hello&quot;         (事件 A)&#10;操作 2: Bob 回复 &quot;Hi Alice!&quot;       (事件 B, 因果依赖 A)&#10;操作 3: Carol 发帖 &quot;Good morning&quot;  (事件 C, 与 A/B 无因果关系)&#10;&#10;因果一致性保证:&#10;- 所有节点都先看到 A 再看到 B (因果顺序)&#10;- C 相对于 A/B 的顺序在不同节点可以不同 (并发操作)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>操作 1: Alice 发帖 \"Hello\"         (事件 A)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>操作 2: Bob 回复 \"Hi Alice!\"       (事件 B, 因果依赖 A)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>操作 3: Carol 发帖 \"Good morning\"  (事件 C, 与 A/B 无因果关系)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>因果一致性保证:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>- 所有节点都先看到 A 再看到 B (因果顺序)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>- C 相对于 A/B 的顺序在不同节点可以不同 (并发操作)</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>向量时钟实现因果追踪：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"class VectorClock:&#10;    &quot;&quot;&quot;向量时钟 - 追踪事件间的因果关系&quot;&quot;&quot;&#10;    def __init__(self, node_id, num_nodes):&#10;        self.node_id = node_id&#10;        self.clock = [0] * num_nodes&#10;&#10;    def increment(self):&#10;        &quot;&quot;&quot;本地事件发生时递增&quot;&quot;&quot;&#10;        self.clock[self.node_id] += 1&#10;        return self.clock.copy()&#10;&#10;    def update(self, other_clock):&#10;        &quot;&quot;&quot;收到消息时合并时钟&quot;&quot;&quot;&#10;        for i in range(len(self.clock)):&#10;            self.clock[i] = max(self.clock[i], other_clock[i])&#10;        self.clock[self.node_id] += 1&#10;&#10;    def happens_before(self, other):&#10;        &quot;&quot;&quot;判断因果关系: self → other?&quot;&quot;&quot;&#10;        return (all(s &lt;= o for s, o in zip(self.clock, other))&#10;                and any(s &lt; o for s, o in zip(self.clock, other)))&#10;&#10;    def concurrent(self, other):&#10;        &quot;&quot;&quot;判断并发: 两个事件无因果关系&quot;&quot;&quot;&#10;        return (not self.happens_before(other)&#10;                and not other.happens_before(self.clock))\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> VectorClock</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"\"\"向量时钟 - 追踪事件间的因果关系\"\"\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> __init__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, node_id, num_nodes):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.node_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> node_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.clock </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> num_nodes</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> increment</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        \"\"\"本地事件发生时递增\"\"\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.clock[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.node_id] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.clock.copy()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> update</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, other_clock):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        \"\"\"收到消息时合并时钟\"\"\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> range</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">len</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.clock)):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">            self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.clock[i] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> max</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.clock[i], other_clock[i])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.clock[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.node_id] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> happens_before</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, other):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        \"\"\"判断因果关系: self → other?\"\"\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">all</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(s </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> o </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> s, o </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> zip</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.clock, other))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                and</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> any</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(s </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> o </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> s, o </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> zip</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.clock, other)))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> concurrent</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, other):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        \"\"\"判断并发: 两个事件无因果关系\"\"\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">not</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.happens_before(other)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                and</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> not</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> other.happens_before(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.clock))</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"raft-共识算法\">Raft 共识算法</h3><p>Raft 是当前最广泛使用的共识算法，通过 Leader 选举、日志复制和安全性保证实现强一致性：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    subgraph &quot;Raft State Machine&quot;&#10;        A[&quot;Follower&quot;] --&gt;|&quot;Election timeout&quot;| B[&quot;Candidate&quot;]&#10;        B --&gt;|&quot;Receives majority votes&quot;| C[&quot;Leader&quot;]&#10;        B --&gt;|&quot;Discovers higher term&quot;| A&#10;        C --&gt;|&quot;Discovers higher term&quot;| A&#10;        C --&gt;|&quot;Sends heartbeats&quot;| C&#10;    end\">graph TD\n    subgraph \"Raft State Machine\"\n        A[\"Follower\"] --&gt;|\"Election timeout\"| B[\"Candidate\"]\n        B --&gt;|\"Receives majority votes\"| C[\"Leader\"]\n        B --&gt;|\"Discovers higher term\"| A\n        C --&gt;|\"Discovers higher term\"| A\n        C --&gt;|\"Sends heartbeats\"| C\n    end</pre><p><strong>Raft 核心机制：</strong></p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>机制</th>\n<th>功能</th>\n<th>保证</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Leader Election</td>\n<td>选举唯一的 Leader</td>\n<td>每个 Term 最多一个 Leader</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Log Replication</td>\n<td>Leader 将日志复制到 Follower</td>\n<td>日志一旦提交不会丢失</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Safety</td>\n<td>限制哪些节点可以成为 Leader</td>\n<td>新 Leader 包含所有已提交日志</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Membership Change</td>\n<td>集群成员变更</td>\n<td>变更过程不会产生脑裂</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>日志复制流程：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"Term 3, Leader = Node A&#10;&#10;1. Client → Leader: Write(x=5)&#10;2. Leader: Append to local log [Term=3, Index=7, cmd=set(x,5)]&#10;3. Leader → All Followers: AppendEntries RPC&#10;4. Follower: Append to log, respond success&#10;5. Leader: Majority (3/5) responded → Commit index 7&#10;6. Leader → Client: Success&#10;7. Leader → Followers: Update commit index (via next heartbeat)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>Term 3, Leader = Node A</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>1. Client → Leader: Write(x=5)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>2. Leader: Append to local log [Term=3, Index=7, cmd=set(x,5)]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>3. Leader → All Followers: AppendEntries RPC</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>4. Follower: Append to log, respond success</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>5. Leader: Majority (3/5) responded → Commit index 7</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>6. Leader → Client: Success</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>7. Leader → Followers: Update commit index (via next heartbeat)</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"multi-raft\">Multi-Raft</h3><p>单 Raft 组的吞吐受限于 Leader 节点。Multi-Raft 将数据划分为多个 Raft Group，每个 Group 独立进行共识：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"Data Partition 1 → Raft Group 1 (Leader on Node A)&#10;Data Partition 2 → Raft Group 2 (Leader on Node B)&#10;Data Partition 3 → Raft Group 3 (Leader on Node C)&#10;...&#10;&#10;优点: Leader 负载分散到多个节点，总吞吐线性扩展&#10;缺点: 跨 Group 事务需要额外协调 (2PC 或 Percolator)&#10;典型实现: TiKV, CockroachDB, etcd (单 Group)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>Data Partition 1 → Raft Group 1 (Leader on Node A)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Data Partition 2 → Raft Group 2 (Leader on Node B)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Data Partition 3 → Raft Group 3 (Leader on Node C)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>...</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>优点: Leader 负载分散到多个节点，总吞吐线性扩展</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>缺点: 跨 Group 事务需要额外协调 (2PC 或 Percolator)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>典型实现: TiKV, CockroachDB, etcd (单 Group)</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"实战指南\">实战指南</h2><h3 id=\"实现线性一致性读\">实现线性一致性读</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"go\" data-code=\"// etcd 线性一致性读实现 (简化版)&#10;func (s *EtcdServer) linearizableRead(ctx context.Context) error {&#10;    // 1. 获取当前 Leader 的 commit index&#10;    commitIndex := s.getCommitIndex()&#10;&#10;    // 2. 向集群发送 ReadIndex 请求确认 Leadership&#10;    //    (防止读到已经不是 Leader 的旧节点)&#10;    if err := s.confirmLeadership(ctx); err != nil {&#10;        return err&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    // 3. 等待本地 applied index &gt;= commit index&#10;    //    确保本地状态机已经应用了所有已提交的日志&#10;    if err := s.waitApplied(ctx, commitIndex); err != nil {&#10;        return err&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    // 4. 从本地状态机读取 (此时保证线性一致)&#10;    return nil&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// etcd 线性一致性读实现 (简化版)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">func</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">s </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">EtcdServer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">linearizableRead</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">ctx</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> context</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Context</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">error</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 1. 获取当前 Leader 的 commit index</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    commitIndex </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> s.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getCommitIndex</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 2. 向集群发送 ReadIndex 请求确认 Leadership</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    //    (防止读到已经不是 Leader 的旧节点)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> err </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> s.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">confirmLeadership</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(ctx); err </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> nil</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> err</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 3. 等待本地 applied index >= commit index</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    //    确保本地状态机已经应用了所有已提交的日志</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> err </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> s.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">waitApplied</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(ctx, commitIndex); err </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> nil</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> err</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 4. 从本地状态机读取 (此时保证线性一致)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> nil</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"quorum-读写实现\">Quorum 读写实现</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"class QuorumStore:&#10;    &quot;&quot;&quot;Dynamo 风格 Quorum 读写&quot;&quot;&quot;&#10;    def __init__(self, nodes, n=3, w=2, r=2):&#10;        self.nodes = nodes&#10;        self.n = n  # 副本数&#10;        self.w = w  # 写入仲裁数&#10;        self.r = r  # 读取仲裁数&#10;        assert w + r &gt; n, &quot;Must satisfy W + R &gt; N for consistency&quot;&#10;&#10;    async def write(self, key, value):&#10;        version = self._generate_version()&#10;        results = await asyncio.gather(*[&#10;            node.put(key, value, version)&#10;            for node in self._get_replicas(key)&#10;        ], return_exceptions=True)&#10;&#10;        successes = sum(1 for r in results if not isinstance(r, Exception))&#10;        if successes &gt;= self.w:&#10;            return {&#39;status&#39;: &#39;ok&#39;, &#39;version&#39;: version}&#10;        raise WriteFailure(f&quot;Only {successes}/{self.w} writes succeeded&quot;)&#10;&#10;    async def read(self, key):&#10;        results = await asyncio.gather(*[&#10;            node.get(key)&#10;            for node in self._get_replicas(key)&#10;        ], return_exceptions=True)&#10;&#10;        valid = [r for r in results if not isinstance(r, Exception)]&#10;        if len(valid) &lt; self.r:&#10;            raise ReadFailure(f&quot;Only {len(valid)}/{self.r} reads succeeded&quot;)&#10;&#10;        # 返回版本最高的值&#10;        latest = max(valid, key=lambda x: x[&#39;version&#39;])&#10;&#10;        # 读修复: 将最新值写回过期节点&#10;        self._async_read_repair(key, latest, valid)&#10;        return latest\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> QuorumStore</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"\"\"Dynamo 风格 Quorum 读写\"\"\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> __init__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, nodes, n</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, w</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, r</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.nodes </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nodes</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.n </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> n  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 副本数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.w </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> w  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 写入仲裁数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.r </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> r  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 读取仲裁数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        assert</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> w </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> r </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> n, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Must satisfy W + R > N for consistency\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> write</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, key, value):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        version </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">._generate_version()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        results </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> asyncio.gather(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E