 style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'version'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">        # 读修复: 将最新值写回过期节点</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">._async_read_repair(key, latest, valid)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> latest</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"cap-与-pacelc-实践决策\">CAP 与 PACELC 实践决策</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[&quot;System Design Decision&quot;] --&gt; B{&quot;Network Partition?&quot;}&#10;    B --&gt;|&quot;During Partition&quot;| C{&quot;CP or AP?&quot;}&#10;    B --&gt;|&quot;Normal Operation&quot;| D{&quot;Latency or Consistency?&quot;}&#10;    C --&gt;|CP| E[&quot;Reject on minority - e.g. ZooKeeper&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt;|AP| F[&quot;Accept divergence - e.g. Cassandra&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt;|Low Latency| G[&quot;Read from nearest replica&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt;|Strong Consistency| H[&quot;Read from leader only&quot;]\">graph TD\n    A[\"System Design Decision\"] --&gt; B{\"Network Partition?\"}\n    B --&gt;|\"During Partition\"| C{\"CP or AP?\"}\n    B --&gt;|\"Normal Operation\"| D{\"Latency or Consistency?\"}\n    C --&gt;|CP| E[\"Reject on minority - e.g. ZooKeeper\"]\n    C --&gt;|AP| F[\"Accept divergence - e.g. Cassandra\"]\n    D --&gt;|Low Latency| G[\"Read from nearest replica\"]\n    D --&gt;|Strong Consistency| H[\"Read from leader only\"]</pre><p><strong>PACELC 模型扩展：</strong></p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>系统</th>\n<th>Partition 时</th>\n<th>正常时</th>\n<th>PACELC 分类</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Spanner</td>\n<td>CP</td>\n<td>LC (低延迟一致性)</td>\n<td>PC/LC</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Cassandra</td>\n<td>AP</td>\n<td>LC</td>\n<td>PA/LC</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>DynamoDB</td>\n<td>AP</td>\n<td>LC</td>\n<td>PA/LC</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>MongoDB (默认)</td>\n<td>CP</td>\n<td>LC</td>\n<td>PC/LC</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CockroachDB</td>\n<td>CP</td>\n<td>LC</td>\n<td>PC/LC</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"最佳实践\">最佳实践</h2><h3 id=\"选择一致性级别的决策框架\">选择一致性级别的决策框架</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>业务场景</th>\n<th>推荐一致性级别</th>\n<th>理由</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>金融交易</td>\n<td>线性一致性</td>\n<td>不允许任何异常</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>社交媒体时间线</td>\n<td>因果一致性</td>\n<td>因果顺序重要，精确顺序不重要</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>用户个人设置</td>\n<td>读己之写</td>\n<td>用户能看到自己的修改即可</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>新闻推送</td>\n<td>最终一致性</td>\n<td>短暂延迟可接受</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>库存扣减</td>\n<td>线性一致性</td>\n<td>防止超卖</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>搜索索引</td>\n<td>最终一致性</td>\n<td>秒级延迟可接受</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"共识算法选型\">共识算法选型</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>场景</th>\n<th>推荐方案</th>\n<th>理由</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>配置管理、服务发现</td>\n<td>Raft (etcd/Consul)</td>\n<td>小数据量、强一致</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分布式数据库</td>\n<td>Multi-Raft</td>\n<td>高吞吐、自动 failover</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>跨区域强一致</td>\n<td>Paxos + TrueTime (Spanner)</td>\n<td>全球一致性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>区块链</td>\n<td>PBFT / PoS</td>\n<td>拜占庭容错</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"工具与生态\">工具与生态</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>系统</th>\n<th>共识协议</th>\n<th>一致性级别</th>\n<th>特色</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>etcd</td>\n<td>Raft</td>\n<td>线性一致性</td>\n<td>K8s 核心组件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ZooKeeper</td>\n<td>ZAB (类 Paxos)</td>\n<td>线性一致性</td>\n<td>分布式协调</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Consul</td>\n<td>Raft</td>\n<td>线性一致性</td>\n<td>服务发现+KV</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>TiKV</td>\n<td>Multi-Raft</td>\n<td>线性一致性</td>\n<td>分布式 KV</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CockroachDB</td>\n<td>Multi-Raft</td>\n<td>可序列化</td>\n<td>分布式 SQL</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Google Spanner</td>\n<td>Multi-Paxos + TrueTime</td>\n<td>外部一致性</td>\n<td>全球数据库</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>FoundationDB</td>\n<td>Paxos 变体</td>\n<td>可序列化</td>\n<td>Apple 使用</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"总结\">总结</h2><p>一致性与共识是分布式系统正确性的基石。工程师需要深刻理解：线性一致性虽然提供最强保证但代价高昂；因果一致性在保证正确因果关系的同时保留了良好的性能特性；最终一致性在大多数互联网场景下是合理且高效的选择。</p>\n<p>Raft 共识算法通过 Leader 选举和日志复制的清晰抽象，使得强一致性复制变得可工程化。Multi-Raft 通过数据分片将吞吐从单 Leader 瓶颈中解放出来。在 2026 年的实践中，共识算法已经从&quot;学术概念&quot;变为&quot;基础设施组件&quot;——几乎所有 NewSQL 数据库都内置了 Raft 或 Paxos 变体，工程师的工作重心从&quot;实现共识&quot;转向&quot;选择合适的一致性级别并正确配置&quot;。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"复制一致性与共识算法","id":"复制一致性与共识算法"},{"level":2,"text":"概述","id":"概述"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":3,"text":"一致性级别谱系","id":"一致性级别谱系"},{"level":3,"text":"线性一致性详解","id":"线性一致性详解"},{"level":3,"text":"因果一致性","id":"因果一致性"},{"level":3,"text":"Raft 共识算法","id":"raft-共识算法"},{"level":3,"text":"Multi-Raft","id":"multi-raft"},{"level":2,"text":"实战指南","id":"实战指南"},{"level":3,"text":"实现线性一致性读","id":"实现线性一致性读"},{"level":3,"text":"Quorum 读写实现","id":"quorum-读写实现"},{"level":3,"text":"CAP 与 PACELC 实践决策","id":"cap-与-pacelc-实践决策"},{"level":2,"text":"最佳实践","id":"最佳实践"},{"level":3,"text":"选择一致性级别的决策框架","id":"选择一致性级别的决策框架"},{"level":3,"text":"共识算法选型","id":"共识算法选型"},{"level":2,"text":"工具与生态","id":"工具与生态"},{"level":2,"text":"总结","id":"总结"}],"prev":{"title":"分区策略与再平衡","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/data-intensive-applications/replication-and-partitioning/partitioning-strategies"},"next":{"title":"ACID 与 BASE：事务语义对比","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/data-intensive-applications/transactions-and-consistency/acid-vs-base"}}